  "historyNote": "#13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300); ss by #14134, INTERIM, eff 12-1-24, EXPIRES: 5-30-25 (Remains in effect per RSA 541-A:14-a); ss by #14305, eff 8-19-25, EXPIRES: 8-19-35",
